      <h1>Top 10 T-Shirt Manufacturers in China: How to Choose the Right Partner (2026 Guide)</h1>
      <p class="ar-meta">
        <span>By <strong rel="author">YAUUM Sourcing Team</strong></span>
        <span>Published <time datetime="2026-10-12">October 12, 2026</time></span>
      <span class="ar-views" data-views-for="/top-10-t-shirt-manufacturers-china/" data-views-hit></span>
      </p>
      <p class="ar-lede">China's apparel export machine doesn't slow down for headlines about rising labor costs or shifting supply chains. It remains the single largest apparel exporter by value, and knit T-shirts sit near the center of that volume. So if you're a brand owner in Los Angeles or a sourcing manager in Rotterdam, the real question was never whether to produce in China. It's which factory, at what MOQ, with which compliance paperwork, and how fast</p>
